    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Performing for others has always been second nature to you. You gain the @Compendium[pf2e.feats-srd.lFwfUvH2708rl6i3]{Virtuosic Performer} skill feat. If the performance you pick is visual, you can augment your performance with a use of shift shape to take on a visually appealing form. If you do so, the circumstance bonus is +2 whether or not you are a master in performance. </p>"
